/*
 * Heartbeat — the starter stylesheet (PSS).
 *
 * Colours use `$token` references, which resolve against the live theme at
 * paint time — so this one stylesheet follows the palette in `app/theme.py`.
 * Available colour tokens: $primary $secondary $background $surface
 * $surface_variant $outline $error $text $text_secondary $on_primary.
 * Metric tokens (radii, spacing, type) come from `Tokens`: $radius_card,
 * $gutter, $text_title, …
 *
 * What lives here is everything *fixed*: colour, weight, radius, spacing,
 * opacity. PSS can now express the design's `clamp()`/`vw`/`@media` rules
 * directly — see `docs/examples/heartbeat-css-parity.pss` for the whole
 * prototype written as a stylesheet. This starter keeps the window-proportional
 * sizes in `app/screens/heartbeat.py` instead, because the frame loop rebuilds
 * the tree every tick and the motion needs the same sampled metrics. The
 * heart's translucent tints are derived from the brand colour in
 * `app/theme.py`, so they too are applied from Python.
 */

.heartbeat-screen {
    bg: $background;
}

/* ── Top bar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.hb-topbar {
    min-height: 32;
}

.hb-app-name {
    font: { size: 14, weight: 800, color: $text, letterSpacing: -0.014 };
}

.hb-session-text {
    font: { size: 10, weight: 700, color: $text_secondary };
}

.hb-session-dot {
    width: 6;
    height: 6;
    border-radius: 999;
    bg: #FFD8D5CC;
}

/* ── The pulse field and the rings ───────────────────────────────────── */
/*
 * Only the shape is fixed; the diameter tracks the window (see
 * `_layout()` in heartbeat.py), so it is set on each widget.
 */

.hb-glow {
    border-radius: 999;
}

.hb-ring-one {
    border-radius: 999;
}

.hb-ring-two {
    border-radius: 999;
}

/* The flash sits on top of everything, centred, and pulses once per beat. */
.hb-flash {
    width: 180;
    height: 180;
    border-radius: 999;
}

/* ── ECG trace ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.hb-ecg {
    opacity: 0.45;
}

/* ── Footnote ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.hb-bottom {
    min-height: 22;
    margin: { top: 10 };
}

.hb-footnote {
    font: { size: 9, weight: 600, color: #FFB5B1A9 };
}
